From a0956bd38e657cdd45f30bdf06f402b5513986e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 10:15:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove leftover duplicate view-toggle markup left in the
 modal body

Moving the Formatted/Raw toggle into the modal footer left a second,
hidden copy of the same block behind in the modal body, so the page
had two elements sharing id="log-view-formatted" / id="log-view-raw"
and data-field="view-toggle" / "view-formatted-btn" / "view-raw-btn".

Duplicate ids are invalid HTML, and the browser resolves id lookups
(getElementById, querySelector('#id'), and a <label for="..."> click
target) to the first match in the document -- the leftover body copy,
not the visible footer one. Both pairs shared name="log-view-mode", so
setting .checked on the (hidden) body input via script correctly
toggled the underlying view, but as a side effect of native radio
mutual-exclusivity it also unchecked the footer's own radios, leaving
neither footer label matched by the .btn-check:checked + .btn CSS rule
-- hence "the buttons toggle the view but never show as checked".

Deleting the body's duplicate leaves one radio/label pair per id, so
the footer's own input is what gets checked and its adjacent label
lights up as expected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GdhKf193j6ggwAGFYCUaJg
---
 templates/partials/log_tail_modal.html | 11 +----------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/templates/partials/log_tail_modal.html b/templates/partials/log_tail_modal.html
index 4b92089..8e859e1 100644
--- a/templates/partials/log_tail_modal.html
+++ b/templates/partials/log_tail_modal.html
@@ -13,15 +13,6 @@
         <div data-field="loading" class="text-secondary">Loading…</div>
         <div data-field="error" class="alert alert-danger" hidden></div>
 
-        <!-- BEGIN JSON VIEW TOGGLE -->
-        <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm mb-2" role="group" aria-label="View" data-field="view-toggle" hidden>
-          <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="log-view-mode" id="log-view-formatted" autocomplete="off" checked>
-          <label for="log-view-formatted" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-field="view-formatted-btn">Formatted</label>
-          <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="log-view-mode" id="log-view-raw" autocomplete="off">
-          <label for="log-view-raw" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-field="view-raw-btn">Raw</label>
-        </div>
-        <!-- END JSON VIEW TOGGLE -->
-
         <!-- BEGIN JSON ENTRIES VIEW -->
         <div data-field="entries" class="border rounded" style="max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto;" hidden></div>
         <!-- END JSON ENTRIES VIEW -->
@@ -34,7 +25,7 @@
         
 
         <!-- BEGIN JSON VIEW TOGGLE -->
-        <div class="btn-group me-auto" role="group" aria-label="View" data-field="view-toggle">
+        <div class="btn-group me-auto" role="group" aria-label="View" data-field="view-toggle" hidden>
           <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="log-view-mode" id="log-view-formatted" autocomplete="off" checked>
           <label for="log-view-formatted" class="btn" data-field="view-formatted-btn">Formatted</label>
 
